Chakra UI V2

1. Theme Architecture

✅ Use centralized theme structure as much as possible for component-level components
See current theme structure: https://github.com/SalesforceCommerceCloud/pwa-kit/blob/develop/packages/template-retail-react-app/app/theme/index.js

Follow Chakra UI Styled System: https://v2.chakra-ui.com/docs/styled-system/style-props
✅ Good Practices

// Use theme tokens consistently
<Box bg="gray.50" p={4} borderRadius="md">
// Leverage responsive arrays
<Text fontSize={['sm', 'md', 'lg']}>
// Use semantic color names
<Alert status="error" colorScheme="red">
